      "PREPARE": "Keep your hand comfortably open, without making a fist or holding an object. Allow a natural slight finger curve; do not force your fingers straight or spread them widely. Choose a comfortable arm position and keep it consistent. Do not press your fingertips or palm into a surface. Movement this trial: reach/sweep (starts in SETTLE).",
      "SETTLE": "Smoothly establish the HIGH forearm contraction and begin the movement: slowly reach forward and sweep the arm side to side through a comfortable range. While keeping your hand open, establish a firm, comfortable, repeatable forearm contraction. Keep the same open-hand posture. Do not use a maximal effort, force your joints straight, or press against anything.",
